    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Vanilla is now the first entry in every game's shared mod selector. FF8 switches to its extracted unchanged datasets and disables Save; selecting the current mod reloads the editable data. FF7 uses its decoded Vanilla kernel, RDR uses its prepared baseline files, and RDR2 keeps its decoded Vanilla source. Blank uses its packaged baseline; FF9 and Warband show an honest read-only baseline notice where decoding is not complete. Restart Lexeditor, open FF8, and choose Vanilla from the top-left selector to check it.",
